{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Fold space to cheat your way through puzzles.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/compress_space_1.gif?t=1748321334\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Break the rules of geometry and this game's mechanics</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Discover a variety of gameplay mechanics and break them in delightful ways with space folding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/compress_space_spoiler_gif_1.gif?t=1748321334\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Every puzzle is a star in the sky</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master space manipulation to reach beyond the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/level_select_loop_1.gif?t=1748321334\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But what lies at the end of the universe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/black_hole_1.gif?t=1748321334\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.  Solve mind bending puzzles utilizing a space bending mechanic in game breaking ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.  Reach the end of the universe and uncover the mystery of your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Enjoy relaxing graphics and a chill soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664840?t=1748321334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664840?t=1748321334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/c39062e6f0e1368fbd1932891da16a34e9c43412/cap